  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Hazard Research Network (ODA CDEL &amp; RDEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This network of expert academic and science institutions will establish operational structures that facilitate production of multi-disciplinary research, science advice and expertise across the breadth of hazards and expertise. It would be envisaged to grow and expand its offer to produce research related to a wider range of hazards and crises over time.</narrative>
